  "name": "Question 10",
  "problem": "Let $G=HM.$ What is the value of ${g}_{32}$, if\n\n$$\nH=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 4 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 0 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 4 & -1 & -3\\end{aligned}],\\,M=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 5 & -3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 4 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 0 & 5\\end{aligned}]?\n$$\n\n${g}_{32}=$\n{{field-1}}",
  "worked_solution": "Multiplying the $3$rd row in $H$ by the $2$nd column in $M$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}_{32} & =[\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 & -2 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =5\\cdot 0+0\\cdot 5+(-2)\\cdot (-2)+3\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =0+0+4+9 \\\\  & =13.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
